{
  "id": "DEU.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 29",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA sea fuga Israeli aba ng'eanyiida Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh ng'asheega neajeeda gil, ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa gideaba gwasin sea fuga Israeli aba ng'eanyiida Moabu, ea neajeeda ghayi sin sea saawa aba ng'eanyiida Horebu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Musa fuga Israeli sean ak gwayeesha saawa, “Noadaayi ng'asheega sean sissa NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeedeang'wa aba ng'eanyiida Misri, aba heeda Farao sea fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda ea ng'eanyiidaanyi sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'asheega hees idaahi, ea gwadeagwajeega, ea gea hees deamdeameadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak askweareani NG'UTAMIIDA maygagoonyi fughareeda jea nalana, ghana gheanyanga jea ang'weardaawana, ghana iidiga jea iinyana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea neawi madeedeang'wa gweanyeew haradam aba jeeda dareapcheeda, nea eara hang'weakeagwa ea mii gameewa aba badahuukeagwa, nea eara geekeagwa ea mii goosha aba geeshangeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea mii ayaaga mukaate, nea mii aleaha difaayi ghana gilijea gooboogit siida, ak gajanala gideaba ghaawaschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak damanda oopkaani hiji, abeeda ghapka ng'ucheeda aba heedeanya sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Sihoni ea dea Heshboni, ea Ogu sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Bashani, ak geajoarji saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean geegeandi ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ak geatawji gwahearan geaba Rubeni ea geaba Gadi, ea eemeeda ng'ay bea Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi eang'waanya muuchi sinoodeaba ng'asheesu bea neajeedean ak gajanyagaada aba ng'asheega sean oosinyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eanean noamiinaadi sean askweareani aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ea fugeagwa hees bea eemeedeang'wa, ea gweargweagwa, ea shirikarajeegeagwa hees, ea headiga sean bea Israeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diibigeagwa, ea gadeemgeagwa, ea rabascheanda mida jeeda museasoodeang'wa, sea dea beara gheawungaagu, ea dea ramu beagaagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajuna jeeda habeawooda neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ghayi sinneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U askweareani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak niny ghamneawa gaygoomajeegeegwa ahuwa fugaaschi, nea niny ghoah ASEETEANG'WA, gawuurji gidaghayi akta habeawooda aba heeda ghweanigeagwa was Abrahamu, ea Isaka ea Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea maydasin habeawooni ea neajeeda nea goobea geat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sighus ninyeeda manda hiji ea aseasa askweareani, ak gawuurji sea ninyeeda miinaada aba hiji eaweecheanji aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agooga ghoanali gidasiipiideati aba ng'eanyiida Misri, ea gidasipkaandi aba bugusta eemoojiga sisku dang'adga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoadaayi searoojiga nyaawa anyareesi buuneeda, ea duguuga nyaawa mawoosa aseecheeka bea geediga ea lagheaneeda, bea lapiya ea dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashageada adagwarina jeedeang'wa ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda ghana fugeaba ghoah ghana eemeeda, dea yamwa gurooroadaanyi eaweecheanji aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak gawa gagadiiyeesa aseecheekeaba eemoojisu, mida bugusteang'wean abeeda gaygawuurji hawunyeanda jih furooda ea haghweega ng'weani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak inyas ghwayiiy ng'asheegeaba habeawooni ea neajeeda, ak ghoadaw geaw siisi ghawooda aba gurooroadaanyi, nea gwayi, ‘Gaydaba hoyyoo eara daweelweelda jeeda roodaweega gurooroodeanyu.’ Ak ghaanung' goosha gea shabeadi ea gea gajeami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA maygwasamsa niny, ak nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA ea ng'weaninda gheang'daanyi gayghoaroasan aroosta aba badaydeaba siidida, ea mooshteayeeka sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani gaygoobiida badaydaanyi, ak gaygoobuus NG'UTAMIIDA gheawungaaschi aba jeeda hing'eadayda humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwasaja NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheega munyas sean bea eemeeda Israeli, ea mooshteayeeka sean bea neajeeda sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani bea deaweedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea seaygoojiga jea ghapka, ea diibigeagwa jea gweada geeshteang'wa, ea rabascheanda leabu ng'eanyiida sheagi, gaygwayi, inyas geadaah sawanadeedeaba ng'eanyiita ea geeyoonung'weaka eadu NG'UTAMIIDA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ng'eanyiidaanyi sean gawuurji gilak beasta, ea balang'da, ea gamurjan, nea meehista, ak ea manda gilirina, ak gwanyarja, gawuurji gidaghayi sinyarjeawda Sodoma ea Gomora, Adama ea Seboimu, ghayi yam NG'UTAMIIDA aba nyarastaanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwayi eemoojiga sean, ‘Ghwasaan anda NG'UTAMIIDA gwasima ng'asheesu ng'eanyiini? Nyarasi hawiin gabwa naaha?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaygwayi headiga, ‘Aba gideaba geanung'waada neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ghayi sin sea saawa aba damanda aruuna saawa ng'eanyiida Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gaweay gagadiiyeesa aseecheeka suuk nea ghabwat saawa, aseecheeka meanala eara siida loosa saawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geanung' ghwayeat nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiini, ak gweadu badaydaanyi mooshteayeeka sean sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gooruuteawa NG'UTAMIIDA saawa jeeda ng'eanyiida nyaawa aba nyarasta ng'waan ak gwajaksa saawa jeeda ng'eanyiinuut ea ghoah ghamneawa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
